{"type":"text","timestamp":1785134430895,"sessionID":"ses_05db2591effe6uNMEfr68CugIz","part":{"id":"prt_fa24db1ff001W0XZ1bmd8prfh2","messageID":"msg_fa24da9680012xZU13abhFBPrc","sessionID":"ses_05db2591effe6uNMEfr68CugIz","type":"text","text":"**PainPal – Day 4‑5 Architecture (≈ 180 words)**  \n\nThe platform is built on a server‑less, cloud‑native stack. The **frontend** is a React + TypeScript SPA deployed on Vercel, taking advantage of edge caching for instant rollbacks and global latency reduction. User authentication and identity management are delegated to **Amazon Cognito**, providing email/SMS MFA and GDPR‑compliant data handling.  \n\nThe **backend/API** runs as Node.js (Express) functions on AWS Lambda, exposing REST endpoints that interact with **DynamoDB** for persisting user profiles, exercise metadata, and progress logs. Media assets—exercise videos and animation clips—are stored in **S3** and delivered via **CloudFront**; an Elastic Transcoder pipeline converts uploads into adaptive streaming formats.  \n\nReal‑time community interactions use **Firebase Realtime Database**, enabling low‑latency chat with offline sync, while Cognito SSO secures forum access.  \n\nThree core services orchestrate the experience:  \n\n1. **User Profiling Engine** gathers pain type, severity, and mobility limits, generating a “Pain Profile” that filters a curated set of ten pre‑built routines.  \n2. **Exercise Delivery Service** streams adaptive media, captures client‑side telemetry, and records completion data in DynamoDB for longitudinal tracking.  \n3. **Community Forum** provides threaded discussions, moderation tools, and SSO integration, fostering peer support.  \n\n**Top risks**: (a) Clinical liability from mismatched routines that could exacerbate pain, and (b) user disengagement if content feels generic or the community is inactive.  \n\n**Fallback scope**: Replace the profiling engine with a self‑select checklist to eliminate algorithmic matching, and swap the live forum for a moderated Reddit‑style subreddit link, preserving peer interaction while reducing moderation overhead.","time":{"start":1785134428671,"end":1785134430889}}}
